      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's great to hear that you're proactive about your health, but high iron supplementation, especially at that level, can have serious side effects. An excessively high dosage can cause sickness, organ damage, or other health issues. Instead, consider consulting a healthcare professional for a blood test to determine if you actually have a deficiency and to discuss appropriate treatment options. They can also suggest safe and effective dietary changes or supplements that can help increase your iron levels gradually.",
